 r←MassageMarkdown md;drop
⍝ Converts `md`, a character vector with CRLFs, into a vector of character vectors, one per
⍝ line, with all empty lines at the end removed.
⍝ Note that this function does not care about HTML tags: `RemoveHtmlTags` deals with those.
 r←{(CRLF⍷⍵)⊂⍵}CRLF,md
 r~¨←⊂CRLF
 drop←-+/∧\0=⌽≢¨r
 r←drop↓r
⍝Done
